  "help_text": "Nmap exposes scan types, installed NSE scripts and arguments, output files, and reusable browser presets. ARP, DNS and fping have separate controls. Select the network interface and targets; save job results as cases. Save two completed Nmap jobs with XML output to compare cases. LLDP needs an advertising neighbor. SNMP uses the device credentials. SMB transfer tests create, verify and remove a uniquely named test file."
